cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Fast and robust memristive cell based on 2D materials for energy-efficient in-memory computing"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and training code for binary neural networks (BNNs) deployed on
  1T1R memristor arrays, including two-stage training with a 0/1-weight
  memristor crossbar classifier, robustness evaluation under noise,
  quantization and sparsity, and circuit-level 1T1R array simulation.
